# Error Handling & Logging

## Failures
- ✅ Use typed failure objects in domain:
  - `NetworkFailure`, `AuthFailure`, `ValidationFailure`, etc.
- ✅ Controllers translate failures into UI-friendly messages/state

## Logging
- ✅ Use a logger package (no print)
- ✅ Redact secrets/PII
- ✅ Log with context: feature, action, requestId (if available)

## Crash reporting
- ✅ Capture unhandled errors centrally (Crashlytics/Sentry)
- ✅ Attach non-PII breadcrumbs for debugging

## NEVER
- ❌ Swallow exceptions silently
- ❌ Show raw server error messages directly to user
